ind":"person","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:xiangyi","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou"},{"id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p006:m0234","start":234,"end":237,"surface":"慕容德","kind":"person","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p006","chapter_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"慕容德","kind":"person","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"德","kind":"person","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p001:m0073","start":73,"end":76,"surface":"慕容德","kind":"person","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p007:r0069","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p007","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"德","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"敬宣素曉天文，知必有興復晉室者。尋夢丸土服之，既覺，喜曰：「丸者桓也。桓既吞矣，吾復本土乎。」乃結青州大姓諸崔、封，并要鮮卑大帥免逵，謀滅德，推休之為主，剋日垂發。時劉軌為德司空，大被委任，雅之又欲要軌，敬宣曰：「此公年老，吾觀其有安齊志，必不動，不可告也。」雅之以為不然，遂告軌，軌果不從。謀頗泄，相與殺軌而去。至淮、泗間，會高祖平京口，手書召敬宣，左右疑其詐，敬宣曰：「吾固知其然矣。下邳不誘我也。」即便馳還。既至京師，以敬宣為輔國將軍、晉陵太守，襲封武岡縣男。是歲，安帝元興三年也。","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan","book_id":"b-songshu-047","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-047-liujingxuan-ws2190557"},{"id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p007:r0086","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan:p007","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"德","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"敬宣素曉天文，知必有興復晉室者。尋夢丸土服之，既覺，喜曰：「丸者桓也。桓既吞矣，吾復本土乎。」乃結青州大姓諸崔、封，并要鮮卑大帥免逵，謀滅德，推休之為主，剋日垂發。時劉軌為德司空，大被委任，雅之又欲要軌，敬宣曰：「此公年老，吾觀其有安齊志，必不動，不可告也。」雅之以為不然，遂告軌，軌果不從。謀頗泄，相與殺軌而去。至淮、泗間，會高祖平京口，手書召敬宣，左右疑其詐，敬宣曰：「吾固知其然矣。下邳不誘我也。」即便馳還。既至京師，以敬宣為輔國將軍、晉陵太守，襲封武岡縣男。是歲，安帝元興三年也。","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-047-liujingxuan","book_id":"b-songshu-047","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-047-liujingxuan-ws2190557"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001","text":"崔光，清河人，本名孝伯，字長仁，孝文賜名焉。祖曠，從慕容德南度河，居青州之時水。慕容氏滅，仕宋為樂陵太守。于河南立冀州，置郡縣，即為東清河鄃人。縣分易，更為南平原貝丘人也。父靈延，宋長廣太守，與宋冀州刺史崔道固共拒魏軍。慕容白曜之平三齊，光年十七，隨父徙代。家貧好學，晝耕夜誦，傭書以養父母。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"崔光","kind":"person","person_id":"822_eba_7d0","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"由本段親屬語境辨識，保留原名。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孝伯","kind":"person","person_id":"822_eba_7d0","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"由本段親屬語境辨識，保留原名。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"長仁","kind":"person","person_id":"822_eba_7d0","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"由本段親屬語境辨識，保留原名。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"曠","kind":"person","person_id":"su1_3c9_tqt","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《魏書》《北史》崔光之祖，任宋樂陵太守。與晉書曹攄敘事另見的崔曠分錄。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p001:m0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"慕容德","person_id":"van_pwm_swv","kind":"person","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note